OL,3,AFilm festival aims to celebrate
OL,4,ABritish-Latino identity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA film festival billed as London's only
OL,7,Fcompetitive Latino film festival is now
OL,8,Funder way, with 60 films from 27
OL,9,Fcountries showing over five days at
OL,10,Fvenues including the Barbican, the ICA,
OL,11,FCine Lumiere and BFI Stephen Street.
OL,13,FGuests include Cuban dancer Carlos
OL,14,FAcosta, a former principal at the Royal
OL,15,FBallet, Argentine actor Oscar Martinez,
OL,16,FCuban actor Jorge Perugorria and
OL,17,FOscar-winning Chilean screenwriter
OL,18,FGonzalo Maza.
OL,20,FIt is running until Tuesday and will
OL,21,Fscreen 60 films from 27 countries over
OL,22,Ffive days.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
