OL,3,AFilm festival aims to celebrate
OL,4,ABritish-Latino identity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event was founded by Cuban actress
OL,7,FKetty Rodriguez who, when she moved to
OL,8,FLondon, was struck by the lack of Latin
OL,9,Frepresentation in a city famous for its
OL,10,Fmulticulturalism, film and history.
